<title>USA: Sheffield wins option on Siemens inhaler.</title>
<headline>Sheffield wins option on Siemens inhaler.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Medical Technologies Inc said it won an exclusive option to acquire the worldwide marketing rights to a multi-dose inhaler made by Siemens AG.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the option agreement were not disclosed, although they include an unspecified upfront payment to Siemens by Sheffield.</p>
<p>Under the agreement,  Sheffield would develop drug formulations for use with the inhaler -- a handheld device designed to provide rapid delivery of drugs.</p>
<p>Siemens would be the product's exclusive supplier.</p>
</text>
